# Region streaming: the sim loads regions around the player and unloads those
# left behind; the controller mirrors that as regions to mesh (one per frame)
# and to free. Region borders fall every 128 blocks; yaw 0 faces -z.

case the regions around the start are meshed one per frame
start walk stream
expect regions.x = 0
expect regions.z = 0
expect regions.loaded = 1
frame 50 x8
expect regions.loaded = 9
expect regions.pending = 0
expect regions.freed = 0

case flying several regions on loads ahead and frees behind
start fly stream
click
lock
down KeyW
down Space
until regions.z = -3
frame 50 x20
expect regions.loaded <= 25
expect regions.freed > 0
expect regions.pending = 0

case walking across a region border leaves no gap in the ground
start walk stream
click
lock
frame 100 x30
mark
down KeyW
down Space
until regions.z = -1
frame 100 x10
expect regions.z = -1
expect eye.z < -1
expect eye.y > 30
expect moved.y > -10
